  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Talks 2021</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Development Talks 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Talks is Sida&apos;s external arena for debate and knowledge exchange. The seminars will provide a well-functioning forum where important actors of change can meet and collaborate on various issues, in order to produce results in the development work. 
The subject and structure of the seminars will focus mainly on methods and implementation of development cooperation.
Development Talks is aimed primarily at various actors working with development issues, such as civil society, authorities, academia, industry and opinion leaders, but the events are also open to students and an initiated public. The theme should interest a larger group of visitors and the target group should be broad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Development Talks &#xe4;r Sidas externa arena f&#xf6;r debatt och kunskapsutbyte. Seminarierna ska utg&#xf6;ra ett v&#xe4;lfungerande forum d&#xe4;r viktiga f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsakt&#xf6;rer kan m&#xf6;tas och samverka kring olika fr&#xe5;gor, f&#xf6;r att ge resultat i utvecklingsarbetet. 
Seminariernas &#xe4;mne och uppl&#xe4;gg ska fokusera p&#xe5; metoder och genomf&#xf6;rande av utvecklingssamarbete.
Development Talks v&#xe4;nder sig fr&#xe4;mst till olika akt&#xf6;rer som arbetar med utvecklingsfr&#xe5;gor, s&#xe5; som civilsamh&#xe4;llet, myndigheter, akademin, n&#xe4;ringsliv och opinionsbildare, men eventen &#xe4;r &#xe4;ven &#xf6;ppna f&#xf6;r studenter och en initierad allm&#xe4;nhet. Temat ska intressera en st&#xf6;rre grupp bes&#xf6;kare och m&#xe5;lgruppen ska vara bred.</narrative>
  </description>
